# PROJECT: Ajangta IT Solutions: Digital Information System, Forms, IT Asset Management & Ticketing System

## 1. Project Overview

Develop a production-ready, secure, responsive, web-based application for **PT Alliance Consumer Products Indonesia (ACPI)**.

The application will function as a centralized Information Management System and Ticketing System, providing employees with access to company SOPs, IT policies, request forms, approval workflows, IT asset information, and ticket management.

The application must be accessible through modern desktop, tablet, and mobile browsers.

### Core Requirements

1. Users must authenticate before accessing the application.
2. All modules must be accessible through a unified dashboard, subject to role-based access permissions.
3. The system must support document management, digital forms, approval workflows, IT asset management, and ticketing.
4. Forms must automatically generate unique document numbers for traceability and audit purposes.
5. Approved requests must automatically generate tickets in the appropriate category.
6. All important actions must be recorded in an audit log.
7. The interface must be professional, intuitive, responsive, and suitable for a corporate manufacturing environment.

Build a fully functional application, not merely a static UI prototype. 

