| New Procurement Request | New Procurement |
| Other categories | Administrator-configurable |

The ticket category must be determined by the form template configuration, not solely by its displayed name.

### Automatic Ticket Creation Requirements

- Generate a unique ticket number.
- Link the ticket to the original form submission.
- Preserve the original form reference number.
- Copy relevant form details into the ticket.
- Associate the requester and department.
- Preserve supporting attachments or provide secure links to them.
- Set the initial ticket status to Open.
- Assign the ticket according to the configured routing rules.
- Record the automatic ticket creation event in the audit log.
- Prevent duplicate ticket creation if the approval process is retried.

If a form is approved but ticket creation fails, preserve the approval result and record a recoverable error. Allow authorized system processes or administrators to retry ticket creation safely.

Display the resulting ticket number on the approved form record.

